{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30556","headline":"风不鸣条 · 卢肇","name":"风不鸣条","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"习习和风至，过条不自鸣。\n暗通青律起，远傍白苹生。\n拂树花仍落，经林鸟自惊。\n几牵萝蔓动，潜惹柳丝轻。\n入谷迷松响，开窗失竹声。\n薰弦方在御，万国仰皇情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢肇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}